{%- comment -%}
  KRAMÈ brand typography (Brand Book v1.0, §Typography System).

    The Seasons — display : page titles, editorial headlines, pull quotes
    Petrona     — body    : body copy, brand story, product descriptions
    Inter       — support : navigation, menus, buttons, forms, product info

  Petrona and Inter are open-source and loaded as variable fonts (one request,
  every weight the brand book lists). The Seasons is a LICENSED typeface, so it
  is self-hosted from /assets rather than a CDN; Light is installed. If the file
  is ever removed, --font-heading falls back to Petrona (see assets/base.css),
  which keeps headings on-brand rather than dropping to a system serif.
{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@100..900&family=Petrona:ital,wght@0,100..900;1,100..900&display=swap">

{%- comment -%}
  THE SEASONS — currently licensed in Light only (TheSeasons-Light.woff2).

  Headings ask for font-weight: normal (see the h1–h6 rule in base.css), and one
  static face is declared across 300–700 rather than at 300 alone. Declaring the
  range tells the browser this file already covers every weight the theme asks
  for, so it renders the real Light drawing instead of synthesising a faux-bold —
  which smears a delicate display serif. It also stops a 600/700 request from
  skipping the family and falling through to Petrona mid-page.

  To add real Regular and Bold once licensed: drop TheSeasons-Regular.woff2 and
  TheSeasons-Bold.woff2 into /assets, then split this into three @font-face
  rules at 300 / 400 / 700 and narrow the Light rule to font-weight: 300.

  The toggle stays so the merchant can fall back to Petrona without deleting
  the asset (Theme settings → Typography).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.the_seasons_installed -%}
  {%- assign ts_light = 'TheSeasons-Light.woff2' | asset_url -%}
  <link rel="preload" as="font" type="font/woff2" href="{{ ts_light }}" crossorigin>
  <style>
    @font-face{font-family:'The Seasons';src:url({{ ts_light }}) format('woff2');font-weight:300 700;font-style:normal;font-display:swap;}
  </style>
{%- endif -%}
